{
 "duration": 24.781,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "At the windy lookout, Mia's fingers were so numb she couldn't open her snack bag.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 4.714
  },
  {
   "text": "Her gloves were still in her pack, saved for later.",
   "start": 4.914,
   "end": 7.502
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Put gloves on before your fingers get cold, not after.",
   "start": 7.852,
   "end": 12.098
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep your core warm, because when it cools, your body cuts blood flow to your hands first.",
   "start": 12.348,
   "end": 17.37
  },
  {
   "text": "Eat a snack, carry a spare pair.",
   "start": 17.62,
   "end": 19.361
  },
  {
   "text": "On the next summit, Mia's hands stayed warm.",
   "start": 19.761,
   "end": 22.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next cold hike.",
   "start": 22.55,
   "end": 24.581
  }
 ],
